---
layout: base.njk
title: Printable PowerShell cheat sheet
description: Every command on the site on one printable page, grouped by task. Print it or save it as a PDF.
permalink: /cheat-sheet/
---
<header class="page-head cheat-head">
  <p class="kicker no-print">Print me</p>
  <h1>PowerShell cheat sheet</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every command on the site, grouped by task. Print it, or choose <strong>Save as PDF</strong> in the print dialog.</p>
  <p class="no-print"><button type="button" class="btn" onclick="window.print()">Print or save as PDF</button></p>
</header>

<div class="cheat-sheet">
  {% for cat in collections.commandCategories %}
    <section>
      <h2>{{ cat.label }}</h2>
      <dl>
        {% for item in collections.commands %}
          {% if item.data.category == cat.slug %}
            <dt>{{ item.data.title }}</dt>
            <dd><code>{{ item.data.command }}</code></dd>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
  <section>
    <h2>Stay safe</h2>
    <dl>
      <dt>Preview a change</dt>
      <dd><code>-WhatIf</code></dd>
      <dt>Ask before each change</dt>
      <dd><code>-Confirm</code></dd>
      <dt>Help for any command</dt>
      <dd><code>Get-Help Get-ChildItem -Examples</code></dd>
      <dt>What is in this object?</dt>
      <dd><code>Get-ChildItem | Get-Member</code></dd>
    </dl>
  </section>
</div>

<p class="print-only">More commands, scripts, and builders: {{ site.url }}/</p>
